Commit sets the commit header, commits the CMS, and resets CheckTx to the committed header.
File: /home/fmorency/go/pkg/mod/github.com/manifest-network/cosmos-sdk@v0.50.14-liftedinit.1.0.20260831215405-b62c931f451a/baseapp/abci.go
